## ERROR 1: CRITICAL - PM2 Sub-Agent Crash Loop (All Agents Affected)

**Affected Agents:**
- pm2_main.log: Gold Main Orchestrator - CRASH LOOP
- pm2_accounting.log: Accounting Sub-Agent - CRASH LOOP
- pm2_social.log: Social Media Manager - CRASH LOOP
- pm2_finance.log: Finance Audit Agent - CRASH LOOP
- pm2_approval.log: Approval Handler - CRASH LOOP

**Error Pattern:** `Claude Code cannot be launched inside another Claude Code session`
**Error Frequency:** Every 3-4 seconds across all agents (~20+ crashes per agent)
**Error Log Files:**
- `Logs/pm2_main.log`
- `Logs/pm2_accounting.log`
- `Logs/pm2_social.log`
- `Logs/pm2_finance.log`
- `Logs/pm2_approval.log`

**Root Cause:**
PM2 scripts attempt to launch Claude Code (`claude` CLI) as a subprocess while Claude Code is already running. The CLAUDECODE environment variable is set in the parent process, blocking all nested invocations.

**System Impact:** SEVERE - No autonomous sub-agents can operate via PM2 launch scripts
**Error Rate:** 100% failure on all PM2-launched agents

**Recovery Action Required:**
```
# Option A: Unset CLAUDECODE before launching sub-agents
unset CLAUDECODE && pm2 restart all

# Option B: Modify launch scripts to unset env var
# In launch_accounting.sh, launch_social.sh, etc., add:
# export -n CLAUDECODE

# Option C: Run sub-agents directly in separate terminal windows
# without the CLAUDECODE variable set
```

**Who Should Fix:** Aliyan (human) - requires modifying launch scripts or terminal environment

