## ERROR 2: MEDIUM - LinkedIn Auto-Poster Repeated Timeouts

**Affected Service:** linkedin-auto-poster (scripts/linkedin_auto_poster.js)
**Status:** 4 failures, then 1 eventual success
**Error Pattern:** Browser navigation timeouts on linkedin.com
- `page.waitForURL: Target page, context or browser has been closed` (attempt 1)
- `page.waitForURL: Timeout 30000ms exceeded` (attempt 2)
- `page.waitForURL: Timeout 60000ms exceeded` (attempt 3)
- `page.goto: Timeout 30000ms exceeded` (attempt 4)
**Log File:** `Logs/linkedin_20260219.jsonl`
**Resolution:** Post eventually published successfully (attempt 5)

**Suggested Fix:**
- Add exponential backoff retry logic
- Increase navigation timeout to 90000ms
- Add CAPTCHA/challenge detection and HITL flag

